  "fullDescription": "Welcome to “Cape’s Cozy Kitchen” – a charming and cozy chef-themed clipart collection starring the adorable capybara, Cape! This set features delightful hand-drawn illustrations in a soft watercolor style that’s perfect for a variety of creative projects.\n\nWhether you’re crafting invitations, recipe cards, planner stickers, teaching materials, or printable decor, this bundle will add warmth, cuteness, and culinary flair to your work.\n\n🧁 What’s Included:\n– 9 Cute capybara chef characters in different cooking and baking poses (e.g. mixing, holding bread, slicing, decorating cake)\n– 9 Matching kitchen element clipart.\n– High-resolution PNG files (5000x5000px, 600 DPI) with transparent backgrounds\n\n🎨 Features:\n– Soft watercolor & kawaii style\n– Hand-drawn and digitally enhanced\n– Ideal for sublimation, printable stickers, digital scrapbooking, classroom worksheets, and more\n– Compatible with Canva, Procreate, Photoshop, and other design platforms\n\nLet Cape the Capybara bring a dash of love and a sprinkle of fun to your next kitchen-themed project!",
